  (2490, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Axial Capital', 'Corporate VC', 'Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth, 6. Pre-IPO', 'https://axialcapital.co.uk/', 'We invest in IP driven or tech-enabled B2B solutions across most sectors. Proven market fit and consistent revenue growth over 12+ months is our starting point.  Based in London we provide structured finance and private equity for growth, and we lead on investment rounds drawing additional capital from public and private capital markets including main-board and growth-stage stock exchanges in the UK, North America and Australia.', '', '', '', '63 Hatton Garden, London EC1N 8LE', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in IP driven or tech-enabled B2B solutions across most sectors. Proven market fit and consistent revenue growth over 12+ months is our starting point.  Based in London we provide structured finance and private equity for growth, and we lead on investment rounds drawing additional capital from public and private capital markets including main-board and growth-stage stock exchanges in the UK, North America and Australia. Invests in: UK,Canada,Australia,France,Italy,Denmark,Sweden,Spain,Poland First cheque: $50,000 - $1,000,000', null),
