  (2517, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'BCF Ventures', 'Corporate VC', 'Seed, Series A', 'https://bcfventures.vc/', 'We invest in B2B Cloud & SaaS Enterprise startups leveraging the power of Artificial Intelligence, Big Data, Analytics and Security. While we invest across industries, we have special attention to Finance, Healthcare, Education, Logistics & Supply Chain, Advanced Manufacturing, Transportation, and Aerospace.

