  (2662, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'City Gold Ventures', 'Startup studio', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A', 'https://citygoldventures.com', 'We accelerate very early-stage startups. Startups without customers are just ideas or products, we help them achieve a strong revenue base as a platform to fundraise from, specializing in B2B SaaS and AI-based startups.', '', '', '', '124 City Road, London, EC1V 2NX', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We accelerate very early-stage startups. Startups without customers are just ideas or products, we help them achieve a strong revenue base as a platform to fundraise from, specializing in B2B SaaS and AI-based startups. Invests in: UK,UAE,Saudi Arabia,USA First cheque: $0 - $0', null),
  (2663, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'CivilizationX', 'Angel Network', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://civilizationx.notion.site/CivilizationX-62a42e05cdb6475fac8e13bf070744d7', 'We invest in these five key areas:

Offering: Hardware, Processor, CPU, GPU, FPGA, ASIC, Memory, Storage
Technology: Machine learning and Deep learning (MLOps)
Deployment/End User: On-premises, Cloud and Hybrid.
Function: Models that can support various tasks (Foundational Models)
Function: Training and Inference (SaaS)

We aim to propel humanity into a new era of technology through the synergy of human and AI capabilities. While one way to address our energy dependency is by investing in nuclear fusion, it may still take decades to see significant changes. Therefore, we focus on the immediate future by investing in the foundational elements of AI infrastructure. This is why we support visionary founders with highly technical expertise.', '', '', '', 'London, UK', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in these five key areas:

