  (2750, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'd.ventures', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth, 6. Pre-IPO', 'https://d.ventures/', 'We invest in tech-driven startups that have a product-market fit, in Europe, the US and UAE.  Typical investments include B2B Saas, DeepTech, FinTech, and E-Commerce. However, we happily look at any pitch deck and forward it to our trusted network of investors.', '', '', '', 'Krotenthallergasse 8, 1080 Vienna, Austria', 'Vienna', 48.2082, 16.3738, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in tech-driven startups that have a product-market fit, in Europe, the US and UAE.  Typical investments include B2B Saas, DeepTech, FinTech, and E-Commerce. However, we happily look at any pitch deck and forward it to our trusted network of investors. Invests in: Germany,Austria,Switzerland,UAE,USA,Canada,Spain,France,Denmark,Netherlands,Sweden,Belgium,Italy,Finland,Norway,UK,Bulgaria First cheque: $50,000 - $2,000,000', null),
  (2751, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'D2 Double Down', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://d2.fund/', 'We invest in SaaS, cybersecurity, fintech, ecommerce (although rare), mobility, no-code.

We invest in founders who want to build profitable tech or tech enabled businesses. We are sector agnostic but prefer high margin products sold on a recurring basis by remote first teams.

Double Down is a different type of venture fund. We back real businesses at the early stage.

As a fund, we seek equity efficient ‘default alive’ technology and technology enabled start-ups that focus on revenue, unit economics and profitability instead of just meaningless paper valuations, headcount and ‘the next round’.

We value start-ups with sustainable business models, not just believable financial models. We like companies that want to stay in business, not run for the exit. We believe these businesses are the future of technology entrepreneurship.', '', '', '', 'London, UK', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in SaaS, cybersecurity, fintech, ecommerce (although rare), mobility, no-code.

We invest in founders who want to build profitable tech or tech enabled businesses. We are sector agnostic but prefer high margin products sold on a recurring basis by remote first teams.

Double Down is a different type of venture fund. We back real businesses at the early stage.

As a fund, we seek equity efficient ‘default alive’ technology and technology enabled start-ups that focus on revenue, unit economics and profitability instead of just meaningless paper valuations, headcount and ‘the next round’.

We value start-ups with sustainable business models, not just believable financial models. We like companies that want to stay in business, not run for the exit. We believe these businesses are the future of technology entrepreneurship. Invests in: UK,Germany,France,Belgium,Spain,Italy,Ireland,Switzerland,Portugal,Norway,Sweden,Turkey First cheque: $100,000 - $750,000', null)
