  (2990, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Fund Fashion VC', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://fundfashionvc.com/', 'We invest in companies empowering Africa’s creative economy through fashion innovation. We back early-stage startups using AI, AR/VR, Web3, and SaaS solutions to drive sustainability, supply chain efficiency, and digital commerce. We invest in visionary founders merging fashion, culture, and technology to build scalable, impact-driven businesses that redefine the future of Africa’s fashion ecosystem.', '', '', '', '9th Street Osborne, Ikoyi, Lagos State, Nigeria', '9th Street Osborne', null, null, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in companies empowering Africa’s creative economy through fashion innovation. We back early-stage startups using AI, AR/VR, Web3, and SaaS solutions to drive sustainability, supply chain efficiency, and digital commerce. We invest in visionary founders merging fashion, culture, and technology to build scalable, impact-driven businesses that redefine the future of Africa’s fashion ecosystem. Invests in: Nigeria,USA,Israel,UK First cheque: $1,000 - $1,000', null),
