  (3089, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Hard2beat', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A', 'https://hard2beat.vc/', 'We invest in early-stage Polish deeptech startups with a clear technological edge, solving hard problems through software-driven or hardware-enabled solutions. Our focus areas include dual-use, spacetech, biotech, medtech, IoT, enterprise software, devtools, manufacturing, quantum computing.', '', '', '', 'Wroclaw, Poland', 'Poland', 52.2297, 21.0122, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in early-stage Polish deeptech startups with a clear technological edge, solving hard problems through software-driven or hardware-enabled solutions. Our focus areas include dual-use, spacetech, biotech, medtech, IoT, enterprise software, devtools, manufacturing, quantum computing. Invests in: Poland First cheque: $130,000 - $800,000', null),
