  (3103, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Helsana HealthInvest', 'Corporate VC', 'Seed, Series A', 'https://www.helsana.ch/en/helsana-group/about-us/healthinvest.html', 'We invest in start-ups that improve patients’ access to healthcare. We invest in companies that can demonstrate traction with a scalable business model and are already active in or want to enter the Swiss market.

