  (3303, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Kickstart Innovation', 'Incubator, Accelerator', 'Series A', 'https://www.kickstart-innovation.com/', 'We accelerate startups in New Work & Learning, Finance & Insurance, Food & Retail, Health & Wellbeing, Smart Cities. 

