  (3306, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Kinetic Investments', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://ki.uk/', 'We invest in practical AI applications to transform traditional digital business models, with a focus on B2C innovation that reshapes industries and enhances everyday life. We prioritise regions with untapped potential, including MENA, SEA, CEE, South Asia, and LATAM, while helping portfolio companies scale efficiently across key functions.', '', '', '', 'Office 401 34-37 Liverpool Street, London, England, EC2M 7PP', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in practical AI applications to transform traditional digital business models, with a focus on B2C innovation that reshapes industries and enhances everyday life. We prioritise regions with untapped potential, including MENA, SEA, CEE, South Asia, and LATAM, while helping portfolio companies scale efficiently across key functions. Invests in: Argentina,Brazil,Chile,Estonia,India,Indonesia,Japan,Kuwait,Malaysia,Mexico,Oman,Philippines,Poland,Romania,Saudi Arabia,Singapore,South Korea,Thailand,UK,UAE,USA,Vietnam First cheque: $600,000 - $1,000,000', null),
