  (3317, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Kosala Ubayasekara', 'Solo angel', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://www.wrks.group/', 'I invest in Gaming, AI and Tech. USD 10k-100k Pre Seed - Must have a prototype or something to show - underrepresented founders preferred.

Check the following minimum criteria first:

The primary founder cannot be a white guy. We invest in under-represented entrepreneurs only. Female founders/teams, LGBTQ representation and disabled founders welcome.

You should have well cost-controlled operations.

You can be a solo founder, if you are a team you must be a diverse multi-talented group.

You must have a track record of excellence in something. We invest in builders, not ideas.

You must have created a prototype or start of your product to show me. If it can be patented, even better.

Your company must have at least 100M potential, it doesn’t need to want to be a unicorn

You must have a desire to create and build a sustainable company.', '', '', '', 'Singapore', 'Singapore', 1.3521, 103.8198, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'I invest in Gaming, AI and Tech. USD 10k-100k Pre Seed - Must have a prototype or something to show - underrepresented founders preferred.

Check the following minimum criteria first:

The primary founder cannot be a white guy. We invest in under-represented entrepreneurs only. Female founders/teams, LGBTQ representation and disabled founders welcome.

You should have well cost-controlled operations.

You can be a solo founder, if you are a team you must be a diverse multi-talented group.

You must have a track record of excellence in something. We invest in builders, not ideas.

You must have created a prototype or start of your product to show me. If it can be patented, even better.

Your company must have at least 100M potential, it doesn’t need to want to be a unicorn

You must have a desire to create and build a sustainable company. Invests in: South Africa,Uganda,Brazil,Canada,Mexico,USA,China,Hong Kong,India,Indonesia,Japan,Malaysia,Maldives,Philippines,Singapore,South Korea,Sri Lanka,Taiwan,Thailand,Vietnam,Australia,New Zealand First cheque: $10,000 - $100,000', null),
