  (3362, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Link Capital', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth, 6. Pre-IPO', 'https://www.linkcapital.no/', 'We invest in Nordic tech companies, with a special focus on clean tech, climate tech and software. Our investments range from battery, solar, EV, EV charging, mobility, electric boats and a wide number of ''smart energy'' companies. Clean tech covers 60% of our portfolio. We also invest in software-driven, highly scalable business models across sectors and industries. 90% of our investment focus is the Nordics, with additional investments in the UK, US, NL and CAN. 

