  (3410, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Maressa Guynn', 'Solo angel', '6. Pre-IPO', '', 'I invest in early-stage founders building at the intersection of sustainability, wellness, and equity—especially those historically overlooked by traditional capital. I look for mission-driven businesses with a clear path to profitability and a bold vision for systemic change. I''m particularly excited by circular economy models, consumer health, AI.', '', '', '', 'Pittsburgh, PA', 'Pittsburgh', null, null, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'I invest in early-stage founders building at the intersection of sustainability, wellness, and equity—especially those historically overlooked by traditional capital. I look for mission-driven businesses with a clear path to profitability and a bold vision for systemic change. I''m particularly excited by circular economy models, consumer health, AI. Invests in: South Africa,USA First cheque: $5,000 - $25,000', null),
