Investment philosophy: We believe that the most exciting B2B start-ups are no longer just emerging in major cities such as Berlin, but increasingly in industrial hinterlands. Investment focus: With our first fund (€40 million), we support teams from Europe and invest in the earliest stages, but are open to discussions up to Series A. We are interested in teams that solve highly technical challenges and/or address social issues that fit our network. In it for the long haul. Invests in: Germany First cheque: $20,000 - $1,000,000', null),
