  (3665, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Phoenix Venture Partners Ltd.', 'Venture Fund', 'Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth', 'https://pvp-me.com/', 'We invest in seven technology sectors including Fintech & Insuretech, Healthtech, Agritech & Foodtech, Edtech, Enertech, Logtech & mobility, and Consumer tech. We are keen to fund business models and technologies with the potential to disrupt B2C and B2B markets across the GCC, the MENA and the G20 economies. We are backing early-stage companies in Seed, Series A and B with a Capital Allocation strategy of up to 5% in scouting, up to 35%-40% in first investments, and up to 60% in follow-ons. Our typical investments range from USD 100,000 to USD 7.5 million, with an opportunity to invest a total of up to USD 7.5 million into one company over its lifetime.', '', '', '', 'Al Maryah Island, ADGM square, Al Maqam Tower, 34th floor, Office 3415, Abu Dhabi, UAE', 'Uae', 25.2048, 55.2708, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in seven technology sectors including Fintech & Insuretech, Healthtech, Agritech & Foodtech, Edtech, Enertech, Logtech & mobility, and Consumer tech. We are keen to fund business models and technologies with the potential to disrupt B2C and B2B markets across the GCC, the MENA and the G20 economies. We are backing early-stage companies in Seed, Series A and B with a Capital Allocation strategy of up to 5% in scouting, up to 35%-40% in first investments, and up to 60% in follow-ons. Our typical investments range from USD 100,000 to USD 7.5 million, with an opportunity to invest a total of up to USD 7.5 million into one company over its lifetime. Invests in: Kuwait,Saudi Arabia,UAE,Bahrain,Oman,Lebanon,Jordan,Egypt,Algeria,Morocco,USA,Canada,Argentina,Australia,Brazil,China,France,Germany,India,Indonesia,Italy,Japan,South Korea,Mexico,South Africa,Turkey,UK First cheque: $100,000 - $3,000,000', null),
