  (3759, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Red Pin Capital', 'Venture Fund', 'Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth, 6. Pre-IPO', 'https://www.redpincapital.com', 'We invest growth equity through to IPO, backing visionary entrepreneurs through an engaged capital base, strategic relationships, and proprietary insights from some of the world’s most remarkable people.

A huge thematic focus for us is to solve the capital gap for Early-Stage VCs and their follow-on rounds. We partner with Early-Stage VCs to double down in their leading companies. Small, specialist VCs are the first funders of 80% of unicorns and tech IPOs, but 90% of the time, these first funders lack the capital to follow on in their growth stage winners.

We target venture returns at lower risk and duration.

Our focus spans across, DeepTech, FinTech, IoT, SaaS, Consumer Goods and Brands, Media, Sport, AI, Blockchain and Gaming.', '', '', '', 'London, UK', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest growth equity through to IPO, backing visionary entrepreneurs through an engaged capital base, strategic relationships, and proprietary insights from some of the world’s most remarkable people.

A huge thematic focus for us is to solve the capital gap for Early-Stage VCs and their follow-on rounds. We partner with Early-Stage VCs to double down in their leading companies. Small, specialist VCs are the first funders of 80% of unicorns and tech IPOs, but 90% of the time, these first funders lack the capital to follow on in their growth stage winners.

We target venture returns at lower risk and duration.

Our focus spans across, DeepTech, FinTech, IoT, SaaS, Consumer Goods and Brands, Media, Sport, AI, Blockchain and Gaming. Invests in: USA,Bahamas,Canada,Denmark,Hong Kong,India,Netherlands,Spain,UAE,UK,Switzerland,Nigeria,South Africa,Sweden,Germany,France,Italy,Japan,Monaco,Luxembourg,Vietnam,Malaysia,Indonesia,Thailand First cheque: $500,000 - $10,000,000', null),
