  (4140, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'TVC The Venture Collective', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://www.theventurecollective.com/', 'We invest in defensible, purpose-driven companies within our key thematic areas of interest: world preservation, human empowerment, and life improvement, and focus on entering at the pre-seed and seed, with a healthy follow-on reserve for the Series A, ensuring we build meaningful ownership early, and demonstrate deep value to justify increasing that ownership over time.', '', '', '', '201 E 21st Street, New York, NY 10010', 'New York', 40.7128, -74.006, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in defensible, purpose-driven companies within our key thematic areas of interest: world preservation, human empowerment, and life improvement, and focus on entering at the pre-seed and seed, with a healthy follow-on reserve for the Series A, ensuring we build meaningful ownership early, and demonstrate deep value to justify increasing that ownership over time. Invests in: USA,UK,Germany First cheque: $100,000 - $750,000', null),
