- focused on increasing support along the way
- engaged to deliver business advisory', '', '', '', 'British Virgin Islands', 'British Virgin Islands', null, null, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in early-stage game-changing technology companies in angel rounds, series seed and pre-series A. 

