  (4252, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Wellstreet', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A', 'https://wellstreet.se/', 'We invest in a healthy mix of D2C, B2B, SaaS, and product startups in early stages founded by commercially-minded diverse founders with a growth mindset. Ventures II is a sector-agnostic fund. Our Fintech Fund is currently in the deployment phase and focused on Fintech B2B infrastructure.', '', '', '', 'Norra Malmvägen 143, 191 62 Sollentuna, Sweden', 'Norra Malmvägen 143', null, null, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in a healthy mix of D2C, B2B, SaaS, and product startups in early stages founded by commercially-minded diverse founders with a growth mindset. Ventures II is a sector-agnostic fund. Our Fintech Fund is currently in the deployment phase and focused on Fintech B2B infrastructure. Invests in: Albania,Austria,Belgium,Bulgaria,Czech Republic,Denmark,Finland,France,Germany,Greece,Hungary,Iceland,Italy,Latvia,Liechtenstein,Lithuania,Luxembourg,Netherlands,Norway,Poland,Portugal,Romania,Spain,Sweden,Switzerland,UK,Ukraine First cheque: $200,000 - $700,000', null),
